{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "d7de3fa3d99bcfefe090816f743d6faee6434c88e7e9833bcb4882208a9e79ca", "ja": "……そわそわ。", "zh": "……（心神不宁）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1245fd04a14f910b3a6606e75e8116ea1fc6cb67b5f318379ca113148616ccd8", "ja": "瑞希、そんなところで何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "瑞希，你在这里做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "8f9c00df7c00c02b8357225d047e4ff0bd13a1075f3e6e7edc3b0364b46bfc4a", "ja": "{$P$}。\nはい。気持ちを落ち着けようとしていました。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n是的，我在试着让心情冷静下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "db8b71510056ac6f0d1dbe8d804fb087e21ae58abaaee64238a860002d61c203", "ja": "私も、女子高生です。\nクリスマスは、人並みに胸が高鳴ります。", "zh": "我也是女高中生。\n到了圣诞节，也会跟普通人一样心跳不已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2d19120a4ad678cbc0426d8d9c6d6459b965752aca686011a36831208964c2d5", "ja": "そうだな。\n瑞希はクリスマスに、なにか予定があるのか？", "zh": "说得也是。\n瑞希你圣诞节有什么计划吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "047facb392843d99ab480cc140d8b576ab37c8acb289cb5eb9add7645712ee12", "ja": "学校や劇場のみなさんと、パーティーの予定が。\nクリスマスは、プレゼント交換三昧の予定です。", "zh": "我已经计划好要找学校朋友和剧场的大家办派对了。\n圣诞节的行程就是一直交换礼物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1006_p", "source_sha256": "24290a0391e8282d6897f0fc6853ec5524fdcd432405a6d8035dd53a4dd4e353", "ja": "プレゼント交換か……\nなんだか楽しそうだな。", "zh": "交换礼物啊……\n感觉很有趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "5cf6f8189a7d6058a7a34ea7ce5db03f7e88dfe45cd226c2681b908d6557d767", "ja": "はい、とても楽しみです。\nそこで、私から{$P$}に……。", "zh": "是的，我非常期待。\n然后，{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "8626a9736f2bf6e44572cc24587148de2ff0a93a325485bee6577a5cd201814e", "ja": "プレゼント交換のおすそ分けがあります。", "zh": "我有一些交换礼物可以分给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1009_p", "source_sha256": "42af856784ad412d45331fe78b741b4c5ac7354105e0dcc1d7dab0c686ed54e7", "ja": "えっ？\n急に言われても、俺は何も用意してないんだが……。", "zh": "咦？\n你突然跟我说这个，但我什么都没准备啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "ea1432db56e21d07729663d9e09e9227dae9d085bf5e9aea034435310d82efd7", "ja": "おすそ分けなので、お返しはいりません。\nそれに、物ではありませんから。こちらです。", "zh": "因为是分给你的，所以不用回礼。\n而且我要给的也不是物品，是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ecfc21d2a313f10f750ece6af911b72ba8bd156d919c9c1fdf3c41b55d80f287", "ja": "（これは……なるほど、瑞希に似せて作った人形か。\nはは、小さな瑞希ってところだな）", "zh": "（这是……原来如此，是做得很像瑞希的人偶啊。\n哈哈，就像是迷你版的瑞希呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "e3ffd51fd0d6533abd9d6eae51eac8dc9994e7883136d4f5bd8581e8d909dbcd", "ja": "それでは、どうぞお楽しみください。\n……こほん。", "zh": "那么，敬请观赏。\n咳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1013_littlemizuki", "source_sha256": "693d35a7fcb55d0c193bc82fc8b38c170c539581ff5c07ee887e768cdd23aac5", "ja": "「私、リトルミズキ。\n{$P$}P、メリークリスマス！」", "zh": "「我是小小瑞希。\n{$P$}P，圣诞快乐！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c50e8dbd81102791fee1efdb0d04437f41e38a2e25bd959464b5cb12b2cb4c7c", "ja": "（うわ、喋った！？）", "zh": "（哇，讲话了！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6451e9780d940671aabe35dd0f93f4e81a29794c23616f164b6a041124ec6424", "ja": "瑞希、今のは……腹話術か？", "zh": "瑞希，刚才那是……腹语术吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "b8fc4ce148a736af5ae2ab5f7a0c5b1d58d8cf08227fe2d187fbbdcd4bfdebaa", "ja": "いいえ、私ではありません。\nリトルミズキです。", "zh": "不，那不是我。\n是小小瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b7295b103d980e54bf7d045161c654a97dece7d2d20c919a7ab56aea0819cbb2", "ja": "でもリトルミズキって、人形じゃ……。", "zh": "但小小瑞希不是人偶吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "edb75f508fcf62b5969adee28505d0f4d7e823addd47321f8db497021f5445ea", "ja": "はい。けど、リトルミズキが、\n{$P$}に日頃のお礼を言いたいと。", "zh": "是的，可是小小瑞希说，\n想要向{$P$}传达平时的感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0053_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "ba08c13188c95dae74b9ab78beb95e6aac6f8728d26443a445dc956dafb14c63", "ja": "これも、聖夜の奇跡かもしれません。なんて。\n……我ながら、ちょっぴりロマンチック。", "zh": "这或许也是圣诞夜的奇迹……开玩笑的。\n……我自己也觉得，有一点浪漫。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
